  <description>
    <p>
      Watchtower is a privacy-first SSH, SFTP and FTP client. It gives you a tabbed interface to manage remote servers, transfer files and keep your credentials in an encrypted vault.
    </p>
    <p>What Watchtower can do:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Open multiple SSH sessions in tabs, with customizable terminal themes and tagged server profiles</li>
      <li>Transfer files over SFTP and FTP with drag and drop, progress monitoring and detailed logs</li>
      <li>Store SSH keys, passwords and snippets in a vault protected by a master password</li>
      <li>Configure local, remote and dynamic port forwarding</li>
      <li>Keep track of known hosts and fingerprints to prevent man-in-the-middle attacks</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

